message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HostProfile: per-host behavioral feature vectors for Zeek"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sourbier
    given-names: Nicolas
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-12
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23313580
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23313581
    description: "Version 0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NicolasSb/zeek-hostprofile"
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  A Zeek package that turns raw traffic into one row of 17 features per
  local host every 5 minutes (volume, diversity, novelty, structure,
  rhythm, DNS, TLS), for anomaly detection. Works standalone and on
  Broker or ZeroMQ clusters.
keywords:
  - zeek
  - network security
  - anomaly detection
  - feature extraction
  - intrusion detection
